  "body": "Discover a beautifully renovated home in the highly desirable coastal neighbourhood of Castor Bay. Set on approximately 604m² of freehold land, this property offers an appealing combination of modern comfort, generous living space and an exceptional location in one of the North Shore's established seaside communities.\r\n\r\nBeyond the property itself, the location is a standout feature. Just a three-minute walk from both Campbells Bay School (CBS) and Castor Bay Beach, this home offers an excellent balance of coastal lifestyle and everyday convenience. Kennedy Park and scenic coastal walkways are also nearby, providing wonderful opportunities for outdoor activities, morning walks and relaxing weekends by the water.\r\n\r\nOffering approximately 220m² of floor area, the home provides spacious accommodation with four bedrooms, three bathrooms and flexible living areas to suit different lifestyles. A separate study or additional lounge creates options for working from home, entertaining guests or simply enjoying some extra room to relax. Freshly renovated throughout, the home offers a welcoming environment with updated interiors, allowing you to settle in and enjoy from day one. A double garage adds everyday practicality, making it well suited to family living.\r\n\r\nPrivacy is another standout feature, with neighbouring homes out of sight, creating a peaceful and secluded setting. The expansive deck provides a fantastic extension of the living space, perfect for outdoor dining, weekend barbecues or entertaining family and friends. Whether enjoying a quiet morning coffee or relaxing in the fresh air, this generous outdoor area offers a wonderful space to unwind in complete privacy.\r\n\r\nThe nearby Milford shopping area provides easy access to supermarkets, cafes, restaurants and a variety of local amenities, while convenient transport connections make travelling around the North Shore and beyond straightforward.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for a spacious family residence, a home with room to work and unwind, or a coastal retreat to enjoy for years to come, this property delivers an attractive combination of comfort, space and location.\r\n\r\nWith its freshly renovated interiors, generous freehold section and sought-after Castor Bay setting, this home is ready to welcome its next owners. Discover the lifestyle and convenience that make this coastal neighbourhood such a desirable place to call home.\r\n\r\nAUCTION (unless sold prior): 1:30 PM, 22nd November, On Site at 125 Braemar Road, Castor Bay.",
